g commutant duality across event horizons via To
mita--Takesaki modular conjugation alongside unitary preservation of trace and von Neumann entropy on confined representation sectors, and derive a uniform quantitative spectral trace lower bound for stationary Dirac spinors constrained by canonical Robertson--Heisenberg uncertainty relations.
